                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "53f06f2e-eb7f-3a7c-aac5-b5649004418c",
                        "entry_id": "1e5e9782-d433-3e73-a1fc-f864e68a6b22",
                        "glosses": [
                            "скрытый, не указываемый явно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7c85f2f-2226-43eb-9e93-de8299541ecb",
                                "sense_id": "53f06f2e-eb7f-3a7c-aac5-b5649004418c",
                                "text": "Буслаев утверждает, что в предложении непременно есть сказуемое и подлежащее, явное или неявное ― это всё равно."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da19a028-e1af-41cc-bd14-3455572c7d4b",
                                "sense_id": "53f06f2e-eb7f-3a7c-aac5-b5649004418c",
                                "text": "― Вам не надо быть в монастыре, не надо постригаться, будьте только послушником тайным, неявным, можно так, что и совсем в свете живя…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "232f45eb-29f9-45b8-a848-4e6598ab8782",
                                "sense_id": "53f06f2e-eb7f-3a7c-aac5-b5649004418c",
                                "text": "Для перевода мезонов из неявного состояния в свободное необходима значительная энергия."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6772a161-3305-4428-a7c5-5b5dda85ab9e",
                        "source_entry_id": "1e5e9782-d433-3e73-a1fc-f864e68a6b22",
                        "source_sense_id": "53f06f2e-eb7f-3a7c-aac5-b5649004418c",
                        "target_lang_word": "latent",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "latent",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63a3f3f2-bce1-3aa0-a69f-f8da625ec746",
                                        "entry_id": "627eb6b5-ac71-3da3-90b8-472eb82b0ce4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Existing or present but concealed or inactive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17943c7b-95e5-4165-b137-277ad0bf0c09",
                                                "sense_id": "63a3f3f2-bce1-3aa0-a69f-f8da625ec746",
                                                "text": "There is known latent demand for rail freight and the rail freight industry is working with Scottish businesses to develop new rail freight services, as environmental concerns are beginning to change the logistics choices of Scottish producers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1056865c-d2b5-30e8-a37b-fb487d763774",
                                        "entry_id": "627eb6b5-ac71-3da3-90b8-472eb82b0ce4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Remaining in an inactive or hidden phase; dormant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70b3c0e4-1bdd-44cd-9c3c-68355971209e",
                                                "sense_id": "1056865c-d2b5-30e8-a37b-fb487d763774",
                                                "text": "2008 July 2, Joe Palca, “Scientists Make Herpes Breakthrough”, abstract, All Things Considered, National Public Radio\nThose infected with a herpes virus are infected for life. That’s because the virus goes \"latent.\" Sometimes, it awakes from its slumber, producing painful illnesses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f34e4fa-089a-3f1a-b4c2-27def3133c1b",
                                        "entry_id": "627eb6b5-ac71-3da3-90b8-472eb82b0ce4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lying dormant or hidden until circumstances are suitable for development or manifestation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "latent",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8be210e6-9f98-37dc-9972-e9b9e0f0425e",
                                        "entry_id": "04593730-55b5-3c72-b099-a554eeb8270d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The residue left by a person's finger that can be made visible by a process such as powder dusting; a latent fingerprint."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb53d888-66b7-43c4-af20-3817ea91ad22",
                                                "sense_id": "8be210e6-9f98-37dc-9972-e9b9e0f0425e",
                                                "text": "Once the latent prints have been visualized by the superglue and powder dusting techniques, they should be photographed again. Then the developed latents need to be lifted and placed on backing cards. The latent cards are documented by putting the case number, date and time of lifting, initials of person processing the evidence, and a sketch indicating the location of the lifted latent print on the back of the lift card, as shown in Photo 6.6."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b71bcf00-6209-4780-9d05-45c00cec59fe",
                                                "sense_id": "8be210e6-9f98-37dc-9972-e9b9e0f0425e",
                                                "text": "Paralegal workers do not argue cases in court, and these crimescene fingerprint gatherers do not compare crime-scene latents to known prints of suspects and present their findings in court."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7854eac7-1cd5-3100-8a9e-509f24c9df83",
                                        "entry_id": "04593730-55b5-3c72-b099-a554eeb8270d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An underlying cause that can be inferred from statistical correlations; factor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2f64714-600e-406b-b7a9-5bb273af9d89",
                                                "sense_id": "7854eac7-1cd5-3100-8a9e-509f24c9df83",
                                                "text": "These kinds of latents define the invariant dispositional properties enabling prediction and control of the external environment. Finally, there are the latents that underlie manifestation as relationships of power, as cause to effect, condition to occurrence, or dependent variable to independent variable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ccc25a2-dec3-4ce5-b3eb-2d94d783c9b6",
                                                "sense_id": "7854eac7-1cd5-3100-8a9e-509f24c9df83",
                                                "text": "That is, the observed covariance between indicator y₁ and y₃ would mirror the understandable causal behavior of the corresponding underlying latents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91b0902e-87e1-429c-8194-4fe032d0d3c3",
                                                "sense_id": "7854eac7-1cd5-3100-8a9e-509f24c9df83",
                                                "text": "If one were to compute the reproduced covariances among the latents of the structural model, they might be different from the covariances obtained between the same number of latents in the measurement model."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d460381-a0dc-3960-82b7-762f86ad6f0c",
                                        "entry_id": "04593730-55b5-3c72-b099-a554eeb8270d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that is latent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86386308-df80-4bd5-8e25-81d603950031",
                                                "sense_id": "0d460381-a0dc-3960-82b7-762f86ad6f0c",
                                                "text": "Even if latents may not be actually detectable in any given situation, they may nevertheless be present in it. Latents may become actual if proper triggering conditions are in place, or they may be lost in the process."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5d8ccb5-18a0-477f-b6c5-2254cf2be3a5",
                                                "sense_id": "0d460381-a0dc-3960-82b7-762f86ad6f0c",
                                                "text": "After we discovered Leah and I realized what she was, the flood gates opened. More and more latents have been discovered, as well as cubs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c71cfdd1-c3af-44bd-8041-13292e848f1b",
                        "source_entry_id": "1e5e9782-d433-3e73-a1fc-f864e68a6b22",
                        "source_sense_id": "53f06f2e-eb7f-3a7c-aac5-b5649004418c",
                        "target_lang_word": "implicite",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "implicite",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4857bdac-e3cd-3163-b52c-dc7357cf1947",
                                        "entry_id": "7546cdbf-b88b-397e-b7c3-d7e00827c480",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est contenu dans un discours, dans une clause, dans une proposition, non pas en termes clairs, exprès et formels, mais qui s’en tire naturellement par induction, par déduction et par conséquence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d201688e-15f7-44d8-ab98-7dc7b88b321e",
                                                "sense_id": "4857bdac-e3cd-3163-b52c-dc7357cf1947",
                                                "text": "Alors que le capital économique peut (dans certaines limites puisqu’il y a la légitimité, etc.) se transmettre très vite, de la main à la main, de personne à personne, le capital culturel ne se transmet qu’au prix d’une dépense considérable de temps, et un critère implicite des hiérarchies culturelles est la longueur du temps d’acquisition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c35e288-c0d6-4e0a-a0ab-7f7d05cbc3c2",
                                                "sense_id": "4857bdac-e3cd-3163-b52c-dc7357cf1947",
                                                "text": "Cela est contenu dans le contrat d’une manière implicite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "626d7be9-26f9-4fd4-b429-9137787667e9",
                                                "sense_id": "4857bdac-e3cd-3163-b52c-dc7357cf1947",
                                                "text": "Condition implicite, qu’on suppose obligatoirement à partir du contexte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bf29fb7-7d65-45e5-9412-988d3a0db7f4",
                                                "sense_id": "4857bdac-e3cd-3163-b52c-dc7357cf1947",
                                                "text": "Foi implicite, celle d’un homme qui, sans être instruit en détail de tout ce que l’Église a décidé, se soumet à tout ce qu’elle croit;par extension, confiance absolue dans l’opinion, dans les paroles de quelqu’un."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ffa6ad9-e9fe-4715-a0f9-2951b051f6fc",
                                                "sense_id": "4857bdac-e3cd-3163-b52c-dc7357cf1947",
                                                "text": "Volonté implicite, celle qui se manifeste, moins par des paroles que par certaines actions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e99a7aac-641b-4836-8a70-9313711f8490",
                                                "sense_id": "4857bdac-e3cd-3163-b52c-dc7357cf1947",
                                                "text": "Fonction implicite, se dit d'une grandeur reliée à une autre par une équation qui n’est pas résolue par rapport à la première ; se dit aussi de l’équation qui exprime ces conditions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0f41693-31d4-37d1-9189-355288608152",
                                        "entry_id": "7546cdbf-b88b-397e-b7c3-d7e00827c480",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui n'est pas explicitement contenu dans un contexte clair, exprès et formel, mais qui est susceptible d'être supposé ou compris par induction, par déduction et par conséquence, tels que des bonnes pratiques ou des attentes raisonnables."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18600bb8-c956-4ae8-86b1-522a6a8321a5",
                                                "sense_id": "c0f41693-31d4-37d1-9189-355288608152",
                                                "text": "Il comprend aussi des zones implicites, plus ou moins claires : des \"bonnes pratiques\", des \"attentes raisonnables\" vis-à-vis des comportements, voire des présupposés ou des hypothèses totalement implicites sur les comportements des différents acteurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "implicite",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e11dd4c-02fb-3834-bea8-1f42dfdabf4f",
                                        "entry_id": "cdbb1166-f885-35b1-935f-15fd61eb7e52",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Contenu d'un discours qui, sous-entendu, est, quoique non formulé expressément, immédiatement compris de tous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f109c328-a4ef-4780-9efa-e4a822396b13",
                                                "sense_id": "4e11dd4c-02fb-3834-bea8-1f42dfdabf4f",
                                                "text": "Un autre élément qui peut bloquer l’apprentissage est la méconnaissance ou l’incapacité de décoder l’implicite culturel, qui peut déstabiliser les apprenants et leur créer un obstacle : l’implicite culturel est le fruit d’une histoire sociale, d’événements élaborés et partagés qui font fonctionner la communication."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
